<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Fading Lines</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;*IN PROGRESS*&lt;br /&gt;Adora and Catra are both dealing with deep emotional baggage, and their rivalry has turned into a mix of tension and unspoken feelings. Adora is struggling with guilt, loneliness, and the pressure of her parents' expectations after leaving her old life behind. Catra, determined to prove herself, keeps her walls high and her emotions guarded.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Despite their constant bickering, a simmering attraction between them canâ€™t be ignored. As they navigate grad school, personal insecurities, and the weight of their shared past, theyâ€™re forced to confront painful memories and feelings that still connect them. The story follows their journey of healing, forgiveness, and the slow burn of enemies to lovers, filled with emotional tension and awkward moments.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>feralcocomellon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
